Z||000000||Adrift||09-14-2001||12:35 AM||||What are the best speaker upgrades you can make in the FIero without adding a subwoofer?<BR>Assume that there are no headrest speakers.<BR>I've already had Pioneer 4x10 speakers (TS-A4103) suggested to me... What other 4x10 speakers Provide the same high quality as the pioneers? Are there other places I can upgrade the speakers?||||reg||1
